# TODO: Person C — Cup Stacking Instances (Primary Task)
#
# Define at minimum:
#   g02:blueCup01   a cap:Cup
#   g02:pinkCup01   a cap:Cup
#
# Each instance should include:
#   cap:hasAffordance      (link to a GraspingAffordance individual)
#   cap:hasTaskRole        cap:TargetObject
#   cap:hasColor           "blue" / "pink"
#   cap:hasObjectLabel     (label used in your course project, e.g. "blue_cup")
#   cap:hasPoseFrame       (pose-frame id from your simulation, if available)
#   rdfs:label             human-readable name
#   rdfs:comment           short explanation
#
# Also define the affordance individuals, e.g.:
#   g02:blueCupGraspingAffordance   a cap:GraspingAffordance
#   g02:pinkCupGraspingAffordance   a cap:GraspingAffordance
# ==============================================================



